        "id": 8556,
        "name": "Prestige Worldwide",
        "username": "Prestige_Worldwide",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/96bed5/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-23T15:17:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Let's be real here: Miss Information's alternate-universe-self story? Not real. For my money, what happens after she's beaten, and taken into custody:</p><p>Miss Information: &lt;yells convoluted story&gt;</p><p>Tachyon: Well bless my gyroscopes! A genuine alternate-dimension near-death experience lady! Let's do some tests!</p><p>Miss Infomation: &lt;bleeeeeeeeeep&gt;</p><p>SEVERAL HOURS LATER</p><p>Unity: Tacky! What is up with that x-ray you're lookin' at?</p><p>Tachyon: It's Amina's brain. Look at this mass in the center of it. We may be seeing a different evolutionary path branching off in her alternate dimension...</p><p>Absolute Zero, walking by contemplating the injustices of the health care system, takes a look: Lady, that's a tumor.</p><p>Tachyon: ...</p><p>Absolute Zero: LADY, I KNOW from TUMORS</p><p>Unity: But you didn't have a tumor, you were frozen in...</p><p>Absolute Zero: &lt;significant glance&gt;</p><p>Tachyon, looking at x-ray again: ...Yep. That's a tumor. Biiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiig ol' tumor.</p><p>FIN</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:07.026Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
